{"step_index":1897,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-26T13:37:34Z","content":"Created At: 2026-10-26T13:37:34Z\nCompleted At: 2026-10-26T13:37:34Z\nShowing lines 1-31 of 31\n1: //! op-assistant-grpc — gRPC gateway for the self-hosted Assistant.\n2: //!\n3: //! Routes gRPC calls through the on-host operation.v1 gRPC server served by\n4: //! `op-dbus`. The Assistant listener itself defaults to loopback. Tonic is\n5: //! `10.0.0.2` on `rtly-lungs`. There is no `svc0` port and no `10.200.0.0/24`\n6: //! fabric.\n7: \n8: use anyhow::Result;\n9: use op_assistant_grpc::{ServerConfig, run_grpc_server};\n10: use tracing::info;\n11: \n12: #[tokio::main]\n13: async fn main() -> Result<()> {\n14:     tracing_subscriber::fmt()\n15:         .with_env_filter(\n16:             tracing_subscriber::EnvFilter::try_from_default_env().unwrap_or_else(|_| {\n17:                 tracing_subscriber::EnvFilter::new(\"op_assistant_grpc=info,info\")\n18:             }),\n19:         )\n20:         .init();\n21: \n22:     let cfg = ServerConfig::default();\n23:     info!(\n24:         host = %cfg.host,\n25:         port = cfg.port,\n26:         endpoint = %cfg.transport.rpc_endpoint,\n27:         \"op-assistant-grpc starting\"\n28:     );\n29: \n30:     run_grpc_server(cfg).await\n31: }"}
